{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curse the Cursor</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike shooter set within a corrupted computer. Fight through a twisting digital labyrinth, blasting through infected folders, web pages, terminals, and more. Collect powerful items and weapons to fight back against the increasing infection\u2026 but be careful not to pick up too many curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.poster.avif?t=1772247289\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.webm?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.mp4?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon changes your cursor and your playstyle, from rapid-firing pointers to swiping paint-brush cursors and much more. Curses make every run unique. Some affect how you fight or move, while others distort the interface itself. You can play it safe or embrace the chaos to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, choose from different antivirus programs, each granting active abilities and passive traits that shape your approach to every descent into the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.poster.avif?t=1772247289\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.webm?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.mp4?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious figure within the system can remove curses, but only if you are willing to pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a collapsing network full of corrupted entities, hidden caches, and the occasional shop where you can stock up. Use your limited \u201cRAM\u201d to revisit rooms and keep your exploration smooth and fast-paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118110?t=1772247289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118110?t=1772247289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/d140332f5adffb945fca0ec311dcf492cb234cb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772247289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/d140332f5adffb945fca0ec311dcf492cb234cb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772247289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curse the Cursor</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike shooter set within a corrupted computer. Fight through a twisting digital labyrinth, blasting through infected folders, web pages, terminals, and more. Collect powerful items and weapons to fight back against the increasing infection\u2026 but be careful not to pick up too many curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.poster.avif?t=1772247289\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.webm?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/fa28be2c3b25a99497fc7d173d4e184e.mp4?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon changes your cursor and your playstyle, from rapid-firing pointers to swiping paint-brush cursors and much more. Curses make every run unique. Some affect how you fight or move, while others distort the interface itself. You can play it safe or embrace the chaos to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, choose from different antivirus programs, each granting active abilities and passive traits that shape your approach to every descent into the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.poster.avif?t=1772247289\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.webm?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/extras/ea793bf51c188872aeb4849e8dcc3846.mp4?t=1772247289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious figure within the system can remove curses, but only if you are willing to pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a collapsing network full of corrupted entities, hidden caches, and the occasional shop where you can stock up. Use your limited \u201cRAM\u201d to revisit rooms and keep your exploration smooth and fast-paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hamfist Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/e62aaa2d04c941283ba94fb309148b490c3848e6/header.jpg?t=1772247289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Curse the Cursor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hamfist Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/310a33554dc01fd12c493b27cbffa4e98b817f9d/ss_310a33554dc01fd12c493b27cbffa4e98b817f9d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772247289","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/310a33554dc01fd12c493b27cbffa4e98b817f9d/ss_310a33554dc01fd12c493b27cbffa4e98b817f9d.600x338.jpg?t=1772247289"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118110/55a2a5083c1e6136fa2a134208c56a0e5d1e6554/ss_55a2a5083c1e6136fa2a134208c56a0e5d1e6554.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772247289","path_thumbnail":"htt